            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.121</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">3D Composer</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Big sets.</b> 3D Paul now takes the time large sets need, like a whole city skyline, instead of stopping halfway.</li>
<li><b>Suggestions that fit.</b> Ideas for motion and camera now come from what is actually in your scene, and suggestions you close stay closed.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Workspace</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Folders stay open.</b> Hiding or narrowing the sidebar, switching tabs or restarting keeps your open folders as they were.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
